        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are stuck in an endlessly repeating office. Spot and log the anomalies if you ever want to go home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 anomalies to find!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A portrait of my cat, Bubby</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Sprint 0 has no anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Log anomalies inside the elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Failure will return you to Sprint 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. You may go home after completing Sprint 10.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-90 minutes</p>",
